                        "entry_id": "02aeb3d5-6c92-3fc6-a30c-ed266790b715",
                        "glosses": [
                            "chagrin d’amour, peine de cœur ; état de manque ou de tristesse marquée lié à une rupture amoureuse ou à un amour non partagé."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Côte d’Ivoire"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f1d3da04-5b25-4bbe-b6fe-a46e0cfbccde",
                                "sense_id": "cb287c78-7bf4-323e-9112-d67e155fc212",
                                "text": "Depuis qu’elle est partie, il est en plein goumin."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "98542379-73ee-4e31-a6b8-0494d3d09eaf",
                                "sense_id": "cb287c78-7bf4-323e-9112-d67e155fc212",
                                "text": "« Le goumin m’a attrapé, je ne mange même plus. »"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7c9ec39e-b9a5-4b24-a1f0-3f5ef3b3c7dc",
                        "source_entry_id": "02aeb3d5-6c92-3fc6-a30c-ed266790b715",
                        "source_sense_id": "cb287c78-7bf4-323e-9112-d67e155fc212",
                        "source_sense_description": "chagrin d’amour",
                        "target_lang_word": "heartbreak",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "heartbreak",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "476ba90a-639d-3917-b5a4-39f41e18d7ef",
                                        "entry_id": "c0109e27-da88-32e7-8105-bf1842c40048",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Overwhelming mental anguish or grief, especially that caused by loss or disappointment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac1caa47-bb87-4536-9cb1-dc94f10bbd0c",
                                                "sense_id": "476ba90a-639d-3917-b5a4-39f41e18d7ef",
                                                "text": "So while Ralph generally seems to inhabit a different, more glorious and joyful universe than everyone else here his yearning and heartbreak are eminently relateable. Ralph sometimes appears to be a magically demented sprite who has assumed the form of a boy, but he’s never been more poignantly, nakedly, movingly human than he is here."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cf151816-dc6a-41e6-b46c-563ac78b5ac4",
                        "source_entry_id": "02aeb3d5-6c92-3fc6-a30c-ed266790b715",
                        "source_sense_id": "cb287c78-7bf4-323e-9112-d67e155fc212",
                        "source_sense_description": "chagrin d’amour",
                        "target_lang_word": "heartache",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "heartache",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a8617e33-2d86-36ad-818a-6eadd0f37a2c",
                                        "entry_id": "b33b40e0-e093-3d4f-906e-c8aea8ad31f2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Emotional distress or pain, often caused by a loved one or their absence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a66e2cfa-79af-4ea4-9805-6a76fa395c55",
                                                "sense_id": "a8617e33-2d86-36ad-818a-6eadd0f37a2c",
                                                "text": "[…]: to dye, to ſleepe, / No more; and by a ſleepe, to ſay we end / The Heart-ake, and the thouſand Naturall ſhockes / That Fleſh is heyre too?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b00a6d9-97a6-44a7-836b-c41696fd71a1",
                                                "sense_id": "a8617e33-2d86-36ad-818a-6eadd0f37a2c",
                                                "text": "“Well done, sister! I honour your esprit du corps. When I am a wife, I mean to be just as staunch myself; and I wish my friends in general would be so too. It would save me many a heart ache.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "71b13c71-28a4-4819-a641-e4d9cec440c4",
                                                "sense_id": "a8617e33-2d86-36ad-818a-6eadd0f37a2c",
                                                "text": "She was carrying an armful of Bibles for her class, and such was her view of life that events which produced heartache in others wrought beatific smiles upon her—an enviable result, although, in the opinion of Angel, it was obtained by a curiously unnatural sacrifice of humanity to mysticism."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a328044d-a496-4dc0-aacb-7c67b5b6da30",
                                                "sense_id": "a8617e33-2d86-36ad-818a-6eadd0f37a2c",
                                                "text": "Heaven knows what pains the author has been at, what bitter experiences he has endured and what heartache suffered, to give some chance reader a few hours' relaxation or to while away the tedium of a journey."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
